  "goodToKnow": "Der Landsmann (die Landsmännin) is a compatriot or fellow countryman: Er ist ein Landsmann von mir. The plural is die Landsleute. In sport reports, Landsmann often refers to a fellow national: Der Deutsche besiegte seinen Landsmann. Landsmannschaften are associations of Germans expelled from Eastern Europe after 1945, and also a type of student fraternity."
